    "description": {
      "en": "Whole-organism living reconstruction based on C.ornatus, actual Foerste1916 fossils plus FieldP5173 exterior; not a specimen replica. Main arms can substantially exceed theca height, correcting old planning word short. Three ambulacral branches are roofed by tegmen. Exact variable adult terminal count is selected from documented example, not genus-wide hard count.",
